.TH TARGZIPEX 1 "DTar Manual"
.SH NAME
targzipex \- extract a gzip-compressed tarball
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B targzipex
<archive> [path]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Extracts the contents of a gzip-compressed tar archive to the given path (or current directory if not specified).
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I archive
The tar.gz archive to extract.
.TP
.I path
(Optional) Destination directory.